.TH IKEBACK-MASTER 1 2018-12-07 Ikeback
.SH NAME
ikeback-master \- Ikeback Master Application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ikeback-master
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBIKEBACK MASTER\fR is an application program that can be used for
monitoring and controlling other computers as well as for accessing Ikeback
features.
.PP
Usually the program is started by the end user. It accesses other
computers through the Ikeback Service.
.PP
Using the program you can remote control, lock, shutdown/reboot computers
as well as show a demo, send text messages to users and much more.

.SH SEE ALSO
ikeback-service(1), ikeback-configurator(8), ikeback-auth-helper(1)
.PP
https://github.com/zk26/ikeback

